# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository tracks ONE folder: final-render/
#
# The rest of the vault (the design notes in content/, the wiki, the raw
# sources, the build scripts) stays local and private. Ignore everything,
# then re-include only what is meant to be published.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ignore everything
/*

# except these
!.gitignore
!final-render/

# inside final-render, keep the art and the finished files,
# but never the scratch that tools leave behind
final-render/**/Thumbs.db
final-render/**/.DS_Store
final-render/**/*.tmp
